{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1509","id":4020065684,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87vnVWU","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1509","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1509.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1509.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1509","number":1509,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix learning runtime event RLS isolation","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- Adds a Supabase migration enabling RLS on learner-sensitive learning runtime, event pipeline, delivery, mastery, review, session, reconciliation, and question-analysis event tables.\n- Adds authenticated SELECT-own policies for direct learner-owned rows and parent-owner SELECT policies for child rows.\n- Keeps `learning_question_analysis_snapshots` deny-direct and treats `learning_question_registry_projection` as service-layer/internal because it can expose `question_bank.prompt_representation` and `question_bank.provenance_summary`.\n- Revokes direct `PUBLIC`/`anon`/`authenticated` access to `learning_question_registry_projection` and grants projection SELECT to `service_role` for backend paths.\n- Keeps learner-facing session/review projections as `security_invoker = true` so base-table RLS applies.\n- Extends the learning schema contract test to prevent missing RLS, broad direct writes, unsafe snapshot policies, and unsafe projection exposure regressions.\n\n## Tables Protected\n- Event pipeline: `learning_events`, `learning_event_effects`, `attempt_pipeline_state`\n- Event delivery: `learning_event_deliveries`\n- Runtime learner state: `learning_sessions`, `learning_session_lineage`, `learning_review_tasks`, `learning_family_masteries`, `learning_type_masteries`\n- Nearby runtime/internal tables: `learning_reconciliation_runs`, `learning_question_analysis_snapshots`, `learning_question_events`\n- Projections: `learning_question_registry_projection` direct-denied for browser roles; `learning_session_resume_projection` and `learning_review_queue_projection` remain security-invoker learner projections.\n\n## Policy Model\n- Direct owner: `user_id` or `learner_id` must equal `(select auth.uid())` for authenticated SELECT.\n- Parent owner: `learning_event_effects` reads through owned `learning_events`; `learning_session_lineage` reads through owned child or parent sessions.\n- Deny-direct: ownerless/internal tables have RLS enabled with no anon/authenticated policies rather than guessing ownership from topic, question, family, type, or paper fields.\n- Registry projection: direct learner access is denied; learner-facing question access must go through API endpoints with explicit visibility filtering.\n- Direct authenticated INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE remains closed for these append-only/internal learning tables.\n\n## Service Role\nBackend service-role paths remain operational. The migration grants `service_role` SELECT on the internal registry projection and does not rely on RLS for service-role protection.\n\n## Codex Security Scan Findings Remediated\n- Learning event tables lack RLS isolation\n- Learning runtime tables lack RLS isolation\n- Learning delivery table lacks RLS protections\n\n## Validation\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath api/learning/__tests__/schema-contract.test.js` passed, 15/15.\n- `npm run supabase:audit:rls` passed and wrote `artifacts/supabase-audit/latest/rls-security-risk-report.md` without tracked artifact changes.\n- Local rollback-scoped `psql` RLS probe passed after applying the migration locally: user A own-row reads, user B cross-user denial, anon denial, direct authenticated delivery write denial, session/review projection RLS checks, authenticated/anon direct registry projection SELECT denied, rollback complete.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` passed after push with healthy status, clean worktree, and branch synced to upstream.\n\n## Scope Notes\n- Does not rework Paper Workspace/artifact isolation from PR #1499.\n- Does not rework question-search imported-question leakage from PR #1507.","created_at":"2026-07-09T07:11:53Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T08:16:14Z","closed_at":"2026-07-09T08:16:13Z","merged_at":"2026-07-09T08:16:12Z","merge_commit_sha":"0b8a0a4bdea8bf88713aec00e126a1d1bdf2e6d1","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1509/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1509/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1509/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/dbb3e00dc35496f37763f76d7f31cc7557e673a5","head":{"label":"Samsen879:codex/learning-runtime-events-rls